        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In Table 2 we demonstrate that Influcoder has quick inference, while only being slightly behind LESS on both variants. We specify that for DataInf the scores are surprisingly quite low compared to the reported numbers in (Jiao et al., 2025), despite our best efforts. We discuss this in Appendix A.5. The performance for Semantic is unsurprisingly quite low since the semantic similarity might focus on the wrong parts and miss the dangerous aspects. Rep-Sim performs decently well but underperforms",
